OL,4,CBeach attacker sentenced to 10 years   
OL,5,Cafter victim, 17, loses leg in bank    
OL,6,Choliday stabbing                       
OL,7,GA man whose unprovoked knife attack on 
OL,8,Ga 17-year-old boy caused the victim to 
OL,9,Glose his leg has been sentenced to 10- 
OL,10,Gand-a-half years.                      
OL,12,FIdris Ahmed, 19, from Riverside in     
OL,13,FCardiff, attacked the teenager on      
OL,14,FBarry Island beach on bank holiday     
OL,15,FMonday, on 25 May. He previously       
OL,16,Fdenied grievous bodily harm with       
OL,17,Fintent, and possessing a knife, but    
OL,18,Fchanged his plea to guilty during the  
OL,19,Ftrial.                                 
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
