OL,4,CReform's Joe Martin threatens legal    
OL,5,Cchallenge after being banned from      
OL,6,Cspeaking in Senedd                     
OL,7,GA Reform UK politician banned from     
OL,8,Gspeaking in the Senedd after referring 
OL,9,Gto the "replacement" of white people   
OL,10,Gin the UK says he will seek legal      
OL,11,Gaction to overturn the decision.       
OL,13,FJoe Martin said elected                
OL,14,Frepresentatives should be able to      
OL,15,F"speak up for the people who elected   
OL,16,Fthem" and raise "difficult subjects".  
OL,18,FReform ended a two-week boycott of     
OL,19,Fmost Senedd proceedings on Tuesday in  
OL,20,Fresponse to the ban, and failed in a   
OL,21,Fbid to remove the parliament's         
OL,22,Fpresiding officer                 G2/4 
