OL,4,CBoss who quit #225k role at Wales'     
OL,5,Cworst performing health board drops    
OL,6,Cnew job                                
OL,7,GThe chief executive of Wales's largest 
OL,8,Ghealth board will no longer take up a  
OL,9,Gnew post in England, following a       
OL,10,Gdamning review of her current          
OL,11,Gorganisation's leadership.             
OL,13,FCarol Shillabeer, who has been Betsi   
OL,14,FCadwaladr University Health Board's    
OL,15,Fchief executive since May 2023, had    
OL,16,Fbeen due to lead the Lancashire and    
OL,17,FSouth Cumbria NHS Trust in England in  
OL,18,Fthe new year.                          
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
